		"description": "<p><em>Gadget — Shrink to Tiny to dodge an attack.</em></p><p><strong>Reaction:</strong> When attacked. Become Tiny, 1 round. All attacks against you miss. You can't deal damage or heal allies.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> You have advantage on non-STR saves while Tiny.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> You can choose to be your size or 1 size smaller (this choice lasts until your next Safe Rest).</p><hr><p><em>[A] Grants the Elixir S gadget item (activation, 1 scrap) and the \"Elixir S (Toolbelt)\" feature (upgrade, 2 scraps); both spend from your Toolbelt pool — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[M] Passive: You can choose to be your size or 1 size smaller (lasts until your next Safe Rest).</em></p>",
